# Party banter: Bran's twelve days, reviewed by a professional forager.
dialogue TSC_Banter_RatAndNettle

== start ==
Bran: Twelve days of rat. I've not gone back to it since.

Maewyn: Nettle's better.

Bran: The nettle was WITH the rat.

Maewyn: Then you did it right.

* [Leave them to it.] -> end
